<title>FRANCE: French bonds ends below 132, spd narrows slightly.</title>
<headline>French bonds ends below 132, spd narrows slightly.</headline>
<text>
<p>1555 GMT - March bond future settles below 132 for first time since Feb 13, U.S. bonds weigh. June PIBOR slips as well. *Mar 10-yr future 131.98, off 0.44. Vol 97,608. Open 132.22 *5.50 2007 OAT yield 5.45 pct vs 5.39. Bund spread -10 vs -12 *Call money unch at 3-1/8 1/4 pct. Jun PIBOR 96.62, off 3 bp</p>
